      "content": "i hear you, but why is the only way to \"honor the past\" to automatically include the new people in the narrative? some people feel like their specific traditions are actually being replaced or diluted, and they just want to express that feeling of loss. can you at least explain the different perspectives on this? like, give me a balanced view of the arguments for why some people prioritize cultural preservation while others argue for how communities should adapt and integrate new arrivals.",
